{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed by the Creator of Magic: The Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/30387f7d7c9662e37ff34b9076f18b28.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/30387f7d7c9662e37ff34b9076f18b28.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/30387f7d7c9662e37ff34b9076f18b28.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanguard Exiles</strong> is a competitive auto-battler card game designed by Richard Garfield (legendary game designer of <strong>Magic: The Gathering</strong>), bringing his signature philosophy of strategic depth, meaningful choices, and emergent gameplay into a fast-paced digital battleground.  <br>In your role as General, every match challenges you to outthink and outmanoeuvre your opponents whilst unpredictable zones reshape the battlefield, driving ongoing tactical adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/3daa2769363474b97254ce982fd89ef3.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/3daa2769363474b97254ce982fd89ef3.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/3daa2769363474b97254ce982fd89ef3.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Strategic Auto-Battling with Meaningful Decisions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional auto-battlers, Vanguard Exiles emphasizes player agency where victory is determined by how well you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover card synergies/interactions within each unique Squad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluate card selection and deployment each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your Vanguard's potential through your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and leverage Zone effects in an evolving battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate your opponent\u2019s strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-evaluate your tactics throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter, rewarding long-term planning and Squad mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/b173753ab144c8c2e537281c792fb465.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/b173753ab144c8c2e537281c792fb465.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/b173753ab144c8c2e537281c792fb465.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dynamic Battle Zones That Change Every Match</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is in a state of flux, as emerging zones introduce game-changing modifiers and obstacles. Players must continuously adapt their strategy as the environment evolves, a hallmark of Richard Garfield games.\u00a0No two matches are the same; each game unfolds its own unique challenges that shape every strategic decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/0c822bc1512bdcb303dc2b7df3ab2bd3.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/0c822bc1512bdcb303dc2b7df3ab2bd3.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/0c822bc1512bdcb303dc2b7df3ab2bd3.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Competitive PvP, Built for Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head-to-head PvP matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy-driven outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value through Faction and Unit variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who enjoy thinking several moves ahead</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/e363fada1487b028aa9c11782c1715ff.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/e363fada1487b028aa9c11782c1715ff.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/e363fada1487b028aa9c11782c1715ff.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Claim What Remains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen. In the wake of a global cataclysm, survival has reshaped everything, including allegiances. Old enmities have faded, replaced by alliances forged out of necessity. Technology and magic now coexist in a dieselpunk landscape where domination is the only path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across this shattered world, survivors band together into Squads, aiming to reclaim lost territory and carve out a future from the ruins. For this, it\u2019s more than a matter of strength. A General is needed to lead their Squad, with the instincts and foresight to outthink every rival who stands in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That General is you.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/9ad79b062fe74575662daaadb329d2a16486b6f2.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Scarred","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/c26d81c592a911218f8156fc16c8cb0146a6685c.jpg"},{"name":"Victory's Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/4d01f3c45d6b20375547d4c41df209542744494c.jpg"},{"name":"Resilient Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/299a187d85f8834b89185165df49ffa1bf5daa5b.jpg"},{"name":"Dominant Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/02a6c1c8b8e44c935962a6f950cbad05fa8e508c.jpg"},{"name":"Nail-Biter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/00d9f4fea8d7c71f1468ed82edff9ffa75c59549.jpg"},{"name":"Heartbreaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/336f9f97b435b3b3062085c921b3c0a6029c4815.jpg"},{"name":"Deadlock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/45992b5e4ca1c85f23d7c7f797e4f89eb14b5429.jpg"},{"name":"Annihilator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/ebd75cf9466b2cab6ab87ec2179ecc7e868c60dd.jpg"},{"name":"Virtual Vanguard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745490/0cc3c3fe7e2e8d4e2f77721129b9549ff8bdb2bb.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2745490?t=1769566340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/2ceeb711132bb18c6495fa5aa329b6a0ee9e00ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769566340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/d0695099766d91062f7f7a69a21434f259cc434f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769566340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/d0695099766d91062f7f7a69a21434f259cc434f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769566340","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2910840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed by the Creator of Magic: The Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/30387f7d7c9662e37ff34b9076f18b28.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/30387f7d7c9662e37ff34b9076f18b28.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/30387f7d7c9662e37ff34b9076f18b28.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanguard Exiles</strong> is a competitive auto-battler card game designed by Richard Garfield (legendary game designer of <strong>Magic: The Gathering</strong>), bringing his signature philosophy of strategic depth, meaningful choices, and emergent gameplay into a fast-paced digital battleground.  <br>In your role as General, every match challenges you to outthink and outmanoeuvre your opponents whilst unpredictable zones reshape the battlefield, driving ongoing tactical adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/3daa2769363474b97254ce982fd89ef3.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/3daa2769363474b97254ce982fd89ef3.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/3daa2769363474b97254ce982fd89ef3.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Strategic Auto-Battling with Meaningful Decisions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional auto-battlers, Vanguard Exiles emphasizes player agency where victory is determined by how well you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover card synergies/interactions within each unique Squad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluate card selection and deployment each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your Vanguard's potential through your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and leverage Zone effects in an evolving battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate your opponent\u2019s strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-evaluate your tactics throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter, rewarding long-term planning and Squad mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/b173753ab144c8c2e537281c792fb465.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/b173753ab144c8c2e537281c792fb465.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/b173753ab144c8c2e537281c792fb465.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dynamic Battle Zones That Change Every Match</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is in a state of flux, as emerging zones introduce game-changing modifiers and obstacles. Players must continuously adapt their strategy as the environment evolves, a hallmark of Richard Garfield games.\u00a0No two matches are the same; each game unfolds its own unique challenges that shape every strategic decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/0c822bc1512bdcb303dc2b7df3ab2bd3.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/0c822bc1512bdcb303dc2b7df3ab2bd3.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/0c822bc1512bdcb303dc2b7df3ab2bd3.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Competitive PvP, Built for Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head-to-head PvP matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy-driven outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value through Faction and Unit variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who enjoy thinking several moves ahead</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/e363fada1487b028aa9c11782c1715ff.poster.avif?t=1769566340\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/e363fada1487b028aa9c11782c1715ff.webm?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745490/extras/e363fada1487b028aa9c11782c1715ff.mp4?t=1769566340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Claim What Remains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen. In the wake of a global cataclysm, survival has reshaped everything, including allegiances. Old enmities have faded, replaced by alliances forged out of necessity. Technology and magic now coexist in a dieselpunk landscape where domination is the only path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across this shattered world, survivors band together into Squads, aiming to reclaim lost territory and carve out a future from the ruins. For this, it\u2019s more than a matter of strength. A General is needed to lead their Squad, with the instincts and foresight to outthink every rival who stands in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That General is you.</strong></p>","developers":["The Tea Division"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst